    "turn_text": "I'm well, I'm well, and I'm calling because you mentioned something that I think is really important. And what was that? Well, what we noticed about the Olympics this year is there's a complete lack of unity around it. Nobody's interested. It's not a public celebration is it used to be but it reminded me of the 1985 hit single by Michael Jackson we are the world",
